{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon skins are cosmetic items grounded in reality that don\u2019t impact gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins can be equipped only by certain factions and are biome-restricted to keep gameplay authentic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack contains cosmetic items for the USA and the USMC factions. The improvised, taped-up Field Mod skin can be applied to the following weapons:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M4A1 and M4 Carbines (USA and USMC) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M16A4 Assault Rifle (USMC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M27 Assault Rifle (USMC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M38 Marksman Rifle (USMC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > M110 Marksman Rifle (USA)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > M17 Pistol (USA and USMC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M9 Pistol (USMC)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When equipped this weapon skin will show on desert maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These items can be equipped on the Customize screen which can be accessed from the Main Menu. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925370?t=1756923141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925370?t=1756923141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925370/4f59cdbd42773d13eb9d75102808a8ff18cca610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756923141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925370/4f59cdbd42773d13eb9d75102808a8ff18cca610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756923141","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id"